/// @mainpage livox_mid360_core API reference
///
/// Reference for the public headers under `include/livox/mid360/`, generated from their `///`
/// comments. The design behind the API, the threading rules and the reasons for each choice are
/// in the [API design](../api/) page of the [project site](../).
///
/// Include `livox/mid360/mid360.hpp` to get everything. The layers, from the top:
///
/// - **Device layer**: context.hpp (the shared receive thread), device.hpp (one LiDAR:
///   callbacks, commands, typed settings), frame.hpp, event.hpp, keys.hpp, lidar_info.hpp and
///   log.hpp.
/// - **Recording**: lvx2.hpp (write, read and replay `.lvx2` files), firmware_log.hpp and
///   debug_data.hpp.
/// - **Session layer**: session.hpp (discovery and synchronous commands) and config.hpp (host
///   setup).
/// - **Transport layer**: transport.hpp (UDP sockets and polling).
/// - **Protocol layer**: protocol.hpp (pure framing and parsing), crc.hpp, bytes.hpp, hms.hpp
///   and tag.hpp.

/// @namespace livox
/// Livox LiDAR drivers.

/// @namespace livox::mid360
/// The livox_mid360_core library: everything declared by the public headers.

/// @namespace livox::mid360::bytes
/// Little-endian byte helpers used by the protocol layer (bytes.hpp).

/// @namespace livox::mid360::crc
/// CRC-16 and CRC-32 as defined by the Mid-360 communication protocol (crc.hpp).
